Corrected message:

Fix shape tools ignoring clicks after a mid-drag tool switch

Switching tools mid-gesture (e.g. with a keyboard shortcut) left the
shape engine's drawing/drag flags set, so every later click on
Rectangle, Ellipse, Rounded Line, Triangle or Line/Curve was ignored
until restart. The flags are now reset when the tool deactivates,
even with no document open.

Adds a regression test.
